IWSLT 2017 evaluation campaign: test sets for the MT Talk task 

# TED
# Copyright: TED Conference LLC
# License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivs 3.0

This directory includes the evaluation sets for the TED based tasks
(Multilingual and Bilingual).

For each pair x-y of languages, the xml files

IWSLT17.TED.tst2017.x-y.x.xml	source to translate

are provided. tst2017 files are the official test set of this edition
of the evaluation campaign; moreover, only for the Bilingual task, the
progressive test sets:

IWSLT17.TED.tst2016.x-y.x.xml	source to translate

are provided as well.

IWSLT17.TED.tst2017 evaluation sets for the multilingual task consist
of 10 TED talks, while those for the Bilingual task include 12
different TED talks.

Each talk defines a single document, for which some metadata are
provided via the following tags, when available (mostly for TED talks):

<url>:		url of the page with the text
<keywords>: 	keywords of the talk
<speaker>: 	speaker name
<talkid>: 	numeric identifier of the talk
<title>: 	title of the talk
<description>: 	brief description of the talk
<reviewer>:	name of the transcription/translation reviewer (possibly empty)
<translator>:	name of the translator (possibly empty)

Text is UTF8 encoded and segmented in sentences. Segments can include more
than one sentence.
